# This is the toolchain for an agentic-AI dev container (Claude Code). It adds
# the agent itself plus the search, query, and packaging tools it leans on for
# overlay work. dev-vcs/git is already provided by the base profile.
*dev-util/claude-code
*sys-apps/ripgrep
*app-misc/jq
*app-portage/eix
*app-portage/gentoolkit
*app-misc/pax-utils
*dev-util/pkgdev
*dev-util/pkgcheck

# Provide a system Node with npm for VS Code extensions that shell out to it
# (some language servers and linters do). claude-code itself is a native binary
# and does not need it. The npm USE flag is enabled by default.
*net-libs/nodejs
